@startuml US11 domain model
' US11 REST verification, domain model v0.1. Concepts only: no software classes, no types,
' no operations. Green = new in US11, yellow = changed from the US10 domain model, white = US10.

title US11 domain model (REST verification)

top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam nodesep 70
skinparam ranksep 70
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
skinparam class {
    BackgroundColor white
    BorderColor #999999
}
skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #FFF4DA
    BorderColor #D8C9A3
}
hide circle
hide methods
hide empty members

' ------------------------------------------------------------- US10 concepts
class ApiReport #F6F6F6;line:DDDDDD;text:A8A8A8 {
}
class ApiNamespace #F6F6F6;line:DDDDDD;text:A8A8A8 {
    base URL
    extracting
}
class EndpointPattern #F6F6F6;line:DDDDDD;text:A8A8A8 {
    template
}
class PathSegment #F6F6F6;line:DDDDDD;text:A8A8A8 {
}
class LiteralSegment #F6F6F6;line:DDDDDD;text:A8A8A8 {
    text
}
class VariableSegment #F6F6F6;line:DDDDDD;text:A8A8A8 {
    name
}
class ApiCall #F6F6F6;line:DDDDDD;text:A8A8A8 {
    HTTP method
    URL
    status code
    response headers
    response body
    time
}

' ------------------------------------------------------------- changed
class Argument #FFF3C4;line:C9A227;line.bold {
    location
    name
    value
    JSON kind
}

' ------------------------------------------------------------- new: request side
class Request #C8E6C9;line:2E7D32;line.bold {
    query
    content type
    body
    body state
}
class Header #C8E6C9;line:2E7D32;line.bold {
    name
    value
}

' ------------------------------------------------------------- new: the spec
class Spec #C8E6C9;line:2E7D32;line.bold {
}
class Operation #C8E6C9;line:2E7D32;line.bold {
    HTTP method
}
class ContentTypeItem #C8E6C9;line:2E7D32;line.bold {
    media type
}
class ParameterItem #C8E6C9;line:2E7D32;line.bold {
    location
    name
    required
}
class ParameterType #C8E6C9;line:2E7D32;line.bold {
}
class StringType #C8E6C9;line:2E7D32;line.bold {
}
class IntegerType #C8E6C9;line:2E7D32;line.bold {
}
class DecimalType #C8E6C9;line:2E7D32;line.bold {
}
class Base64Type #C8E6C9;line:2E7D32;line.bold {
}
class Range #C8E6C9;line:2E7D32;line.bold {
    minimum
    maximum
}

' ------------------------------------------------------------- new: the result
class Verdict #C8E6C9;line:2E7D32;line.bold {
    status
}
class Check #C8E6C9;line:2E7D32;line.bold {
    matched
}
class Violation #C8E6C9;line:2E7D32;line.bold {
    kind
}
class Warning #C8E6C9;line:2E7D32;line.bold {
    kind
}
class UnmatchedPath #C8E6C9;line:2E7D32;line.bold {
    path
    call count
}

note as N_Example
    **Example.** Endpoint pattern ""/posts/[POST_ID]/comments"" has a spec with one operation
    ""POST"": content type ""application/json"", path variable ""POST_ID"" Integer 1..10000, body field
    ""title"" String (required), query parameter ""draft"" String.
    The call ""POST /posts/abc/comments?draft=1"" with body ""{"title":"Hi","x":2}"" gets a verdict
    INVALID: check ""POST_ID = abc"" fails with violation INVALID_TYPE, check ""title"" matches,
    ""draft"" matches, argument ""x"" is an EXTRA_ARGUMENT violation.
end note

note as N_Rules
    **Legend:** green = new in US11, yellow = changed (US10 ""ArgumentValue"" became
    ""Argument"" with a location), grey = unchanged from the US10 domain model.
    Bold green lines are new associations, grey lines existed in US10.
    * A spec starts empty; an empty spec judges nothing (verdict NOT_VERIFIED).
    * An operation is one allowed method; every other item belongs to one operation.
    * A parameter item with location PATH types one variable segment of the pattern.
    * A range only limits Integer and Decimal.
    * Verdicts are made when the report is made, against the current spec.
end note

